Purpose of this document
This is a handoff document for another AI or developer. It explains what the app does, how it is built, what the important files do, and what features are worth carrying into a Vercel + Supabase version.

One-sentence summary
MyCoNet Module 0 is a full-stack regenerative networking app that helps people build deep profiles, discover matches, offer services, request help, and connect with regenerative neighborhoods.

Product intent
The app is designed as a funnel-catcher for the regenerative neighborhoods movement. It collects rich identity and bio data so people can be matched by values, skills, personality, needs, and community interests.

What the app currently includes
1. Authentication
Username/password sign up and login
Session-based auth
Protected routes for signed-in users
Public user profiles available without login
2. User profile system
First name, last name, username, email
Country, city, headline
User type checkboxes
Avatar upload
Public profile pages
Edit profile page
3. Bio Wizard
A multi-step form that collects deep profile data such as:

values and principles
personality details
archetypes
goals
fears and traumas
current creative focus
skills
interests
travel data
This is one of the most important parts of the app because it drives matching.

4. Offers system
Users can list things they offer, such as services or goods. Fields include:

title
description
category
compensation model
price
active/inactive state
5. Requests system
Users can list what they need help with. Fields include:

request text
category
urgency
active/inactive state
6. Search and discovery
Users can search for others by text and role. The app also supports recent users and public profile views.

7. Match recommendations
The matching logic compares users using:

shared skills
shared interests
personality compatibility
OCEAN trait similarity
other profile signals
The match output includes reasons so users understand why someone was recommended.

8. Regenerative neighborhoods
The app includes a full neighborhood model for community profiles. Users can:

create neighborhoods
view neighborhood profiles
update neighborhoods
follow/unfollow neighborhoods
9. Profile views
The app tracks profile views and can show view counts.

10. App shell and UI
React frontend
wouter routing
TanStack Query for server state
Shadcn/ui components
Sidebar navigation
Theme toggle
Light/dark mode
The important business idea behind the app
This app is not just a directory. It is a relationship-building platform. The core value is in collecting enough meaningful profile data to support better networking, better community matching, and better neighborhood participation.

