What another AI should probably rebuild or keep
If you are recreating this in Vercel + Supabase, the most valuable features to keep are:

deep bio wizard
offers and requests
public profiles
search
match scoring with reasons
neighborhood follow system
profile views
user type filtering
avatar/profile editing
Suggested rebuild strategy for Vercel + Supabase
Use Vercel for frontend
Keep the app frontend-heavy
Put pages on Vercel
Preserve routing and page structure
Use Supabase for backend
Use Supabase Auth or your own auth flow
Move database tables to Supabase Postgres
Store avatars in Supabase Storage instead of base64
Keep matching logic in a server function or API route
Data model to carry over
At minimum, recreate:

users
user_bio
user_offers
user_requests
neighborhoods
rn_user_agreements
profile_views
